pub const IMAGE_ALT : str = "The bucket under the tap card: a CP2102N receive buffer holds 512 bytes and each answer is 19 bytes, so 26 answers fit. Window 64 (1216 bytes in flight) lost 574 of 2016000 answers in 424.3 s; window 24 (456 bytes) lost 0 in 427.5 s, on the AX7203 board.";
